{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-post-template-tsx","path":"/posts/vue/36_vuex/","result":{"data":{"allMarkdownRemark":{"edges":[{"node":{"html":"<h2 id=\"vuex\" style=\"position:relative;\">Vuex<a href=\"#vuex\" aria-label=\"vuex permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<p>컴포넌트 별로 데이터를 주고 받기 어렵다.<br>\n하위 컴포넌트 전송은 props, 상위 컴포넌트로의 전송은 custom event, mitt 라이브러리를 써야 한다.<br>\n이 때 쓸 수 있는 라이브러리가 Vuex다.<br>\nVuex는 모든 컴포넌트들이 데이터를 공유할 수 있는 하나의 자바스크립트 파일이다.</p>\n<p>컴포넌트와 데이터가 많을 때 Vuex를 쓰면 편리하지만, 간단한 프로젝트를 할 때에는 props를 쓰는게 더 낫다.</p>\n<h2 id=\"1-설치하기\" style=\"position:relative;\">1. 설치하기<a href=\"#1-%EC%84%A4%EC%B9%98%ED%95%98%EA%B8%B0\" aria-label=\"1 설치하기 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://vuex.vuejs.org/installation.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://vuex.vuejs.org/installation.html</a></p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"shell\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-shell line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-shell\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>sudo<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token function\">npm</span> <span class=\"token function\">install</span> vuex@next\r\n// or\r\n<span class=\"token function\">yarn</span> <span class=\"token function\">add</span> vuex@next</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<h2 id=\"2-셋팅하기\" style=\"position:relative;\">2. 셋팅하기<a href=\"#2-%EC%85%8B%ED%8C%85%ED%95%98%EA%B8%B0\" aria-label=\"2 셋팅하기 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<p>데이터를 저장할 js파일을 만들고, 예제코드를 넣는다.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://vuex.vuejs.org/guide/#the-simplest-store\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://vuex.vuejs.org/guide/#the-simplest-store</a></p>\n<p><strong>@/assets/store.js</strong></p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"javascript\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-javascript line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-javascript\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>store<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>js<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\r\n\r\n<span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> createStore <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"vuex\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n\r\n<span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> store <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token function\">createStore</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token function\">state</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n      <span class=\"token literal-property property\">name</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">'kim'</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\r\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\r\n\r\n<span class=\"token keyword\">export</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">default</span> store<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<h2 id=\"3-등록하기\" style=\"position:relative;\">3. 등록하기<a href=\"#3-%EB%93%B1%EB%A1%9D%ED%95%98%EA%B8%B0\" aria-label=\"3 등록하기 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<p>index.js 파일에서 store파일을 import하고 app.use(store)로 등록해준다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"javascript\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-javascript line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-javascript\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>index<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>js<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\r\n\r\n<span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> createApp <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"token string\">'vue'</span>\r\n<span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> App <span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"token string\">'./App.vue'</span>\r\n<span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> mitt <span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"token string\">'mitt'</span>\r\n\r\n<span class=\"token keyword\">let</span> emitter <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token function\">mitt</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n<span class=\"token keyword\">let</span> app <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token function\">createApp</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>App<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\r\napp<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>config<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>globalProperties<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>emitter <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> emitter<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>  <span class=\"token comment\">// global value</span>\r\n\r\n<span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> store <span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"token string\">'@/assets/store.js'</span>\t<span class=\"token comment\">//\t추가</span>\r\n\r\napp<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">use</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>store<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">mount</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'#app'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\t\t\t<span class=\"token comment\">// use(store)추가</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<p>이제 store.js에 등록된 state들은 모든 컴포넌트에서 사용이 가능하다.</p>\n<h2 id=\"4-데이터-꺼내-쓰기\" style=\"position:relative;\">4. 데이터 꺼내 쓰기<a href=\"#4-%EB%8D%B0%EC%9D%B4%ED%84%B0-%EA%BA%BC%EB%82%B4-%EC%93%B0%EA%B8%B0\" aria-label=\"4 데이터 꺼내 쓰기 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<p><strong>$store.state.변수명</strong></p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"html\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-html line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-html\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;</span>h4</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span>안녕 {{ $store.state.name }}<span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;/</span>h4</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<h2 id=\"5-데이터-변경하기-1\" style=\"position:relative;\">5. 데이터 변경하기 1<a href=\"#5-%EB%8D%B0%EC%9D%B4%ED%84%B0-%EB%B3%80%EA%B2%BD%ED%95%98%EA%B8%B0-1\" aria-label=\"5 데이터 변경하기 1 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"html\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-html line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-html\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;</span>button</span> <span class=\"token attr-name\">type</span><span class=\"token attr-value\"><span class=\"token punctuation attr-equals\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span>button<span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span></span> <span class=\"token attr-name\">@click</span><span class=\"token attr-value\"><span class=\"token punctuation attr-equals\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span>$store.state.name = '박'<span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span>버튼<span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;/</span>button</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Vuex 국룰</strong> : 컴포넌트 안에서 직접 수정하기 금지!</li>\n</ul>\n<p>위와 같이 간단하게 수정이 가능하지만, 컴포넌트 안에서 직접 수정은 이렇게 하면 안된다.<br>\n이렇게 작업하게 되면 데이터 추적이 어려워지기 때문이다.</p>\n<p>Vuex에서 데이터를 수정하고 싶으면, 미리 store.js에 수정 방법을 정의해두고, 그 방법을 컴포넌트에서 소환하여 수정해야 한다.</p>\n<h2 id=\"6-데이터-변경하기-2\" style=\"position:relative;\">6. 데이터 변경하기 2<a href=\"#6-%EB%8D%B0%EC%9D%B4%ED%84%B0-%EB%B3%80%EA%B2%BD%ED%95%98%EA%B8%B0-2\" aria-label=\"6 데이터 변경하기 2 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<p>데이터 변경을 할 때에는 store.js에 변경을 부탁하자</p>\n<h3 id=\"6-1-storejs에-state-수정-함수-정의\" style=\"position:relative;\">6-1. store.js에 state 수정 함수 정의<a href=\"#6-1-storejs%EC%97%90-state-%EC%88%98%EC%A0%95-%ED%95%A8%EC%88%98-%EC%A0%95%EC%9D%98\" aria-label=\"6 1 storejs에 state 수정 함수 정의 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"javascript\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-javascript line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-javascript\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>store<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>js<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\r\n\r\n<span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> createStore <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"vuex\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n\r\n<span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> store <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token function\">createStore</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token function\">state</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n      <span class=\"token literal-property property\">name</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">'kim'</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token literal-property property\">mutations</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>          <span class=\"token comment\">// state 수정 방법 정의 하는 곳</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token function\">changeName</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token parameter\">state</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>  <span class=\"token comment\">// state는 위에 있는 state()를 의미한다.</span>\r\n      state<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>name <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string\">'park'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\r\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\r\n\r\n<span class=\"token keyword\">export</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">default</span> store<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"6-2-storejs에-정의-된-함수-실행\" style=\"position:relative;\">6-2. store.js에 정의 된 함수 실행<a href=\"#6-2-storejs%EC%97%90-%EC%A0%95%EC%9D%98-%EB%90%9C-%ED%95%A8%EC%88%98-%EC%8B%A4%ED%96%89\" aria-label=\"6 2 storejs에 정의 된 함수 실행 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<p>$store.commit(‘함수명’)</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"vue\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-vue line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-vue\">(App.vue)\r\n\r\n&lt;h4&gt;안녕 {{ $store.state.name }}&lt;/h4&gt;\r\n&lt;button type=&quot;button&quot; @click=&quot;$store.commit(&#39;changeName&#39;)&quot;&gt;버튼&lt;/button&gt;</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"숙제\" style=\"position:relative;\">@숙제<a href=\"#%EC%88%99%EC%A0%9C\" aria-label=\"숙