al-property property\">age</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">20</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token literal-property property\">mutations</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>          <span class=\"token comment\">// state 수정 방법 정의 하는 곳</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token function\">changeName</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token parameter\">state</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>  <span class=\"token comment\">// state는 위에 있는 state()를 의미한다.</span>\r\n      state<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>name <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string\">'park'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token function\">addAge</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token parameter\">state<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> data</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n      state<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>age <span class=\"token operator\">+=</span> data<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\r\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\r\n\r\n<span class=\"token keyword\">export</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">default</span> store<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"vue\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-vue line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-vue\">(App.vue)\r\n\r\n&lt;h4&gt;나이는 {{ $store.state.age }}&lt;/h4&gt;\r\n&lt;button type=&quot;button&quot; @click=&quot;$store.commit(&#39;addAge&#39;, 10)&quot;&gt;나이를 올리자&lt;/button&gt;</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>","tableOfContents":"<ul>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"#vuex\">Vuex</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"#1-%EC%84%A4%EC%B9%98%ED%95%98%EA%B8%B0\">1. 설치하기</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"#2-%EC%85%8B%ED%8C%85%ED%95%98%EA%B8%B0\">2. 셋팅하기</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"#3-%EB%93%B1%EB%A1%9D%ED%95%98%EA%B8%B0\">3. 등록하기</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"#4-%EB%8D%B0%EC%9D%B4%ED%84%B0-%EA%BA%BC%EB%82%B4-%EC%93%B0%EA%B8%B0\">4. 데이터 꺼내 쓰기</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"#5-%EB%8D%B0%EC%9D%B4%ED%84%B0-%EB%B3%80%EA%B2%BD%ED%95%98%EA%B8%B0-1\">5. 데이터 변경하기 1</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"#6-%EB%8D%B0%EC%9D%B4%ED%84%B0-%EB%B3%80%EA%B2%BD%ED%95%98%EA%B8%B0-2\">6. 데이터 변경하기 2</a></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"#6-1-storejs%EC%97%90-state-%EC%88%98%EC%A0%95-%ED%95%A8%EC%88%98-%EC%A0%95%EC%9D%98\">6-1. store.js에 state 수정 함수 정의</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#6-2-storejs%EC%97%90-%EC%A0%95%EC%9D%98-%EB%90%9C-%ED%95%A8%EC%88%98-%EC%8B%A4%ED%96%89\">6-2. store.js에 정의 된 함수 실행</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#%EC%88%99%EC%A0%9C\">@숙제</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>","fields":{"gitLastModified":"Oct 2, 2026"},"frontmatter":{"title":"36. Vuex","summary":"Vuex 컴포넌트 별로 데이터를 주고 받기 어렵다. 하위 컴포넌트 전송은 props, 상위 컴포넌트로의 전송은 custom event, mitt 라이브러리를 써야 한다. 이 때 쓸 수 있는 라이브러리가 Vuex다. Vuex는 모든 컴포넌트들이 데이터를 공유할 수 있는 하나의 자바스크립트 파일이다.","date":"Jul 15, 2023","categories":["VUE"],"tags":[],"author":["aluvy"],"thumbnail":null}}}]}},"pageContext":{"slug":"/posts/vue/36_vuex/","prev":{"slug":"/posts/vue/35_mitt/","title":"35. 원하는 컴포넌트에 데이터 전송 mitt"},"next":{"slug":"/posts/vue/37_인스타그램_좋아요_기능/","title":"37. Vuex를 이용한 인스타그램 좋아요 기능"}}},"staticQueryHashes":["1397594759","2043619371"],"slicesMap":{}}